        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: K. Shivaram Karanth\n- Works: Marali Mannige\n- Performing Arts: Yakshagana\n- Music Concepts: Shuddha Saveri\n\nFacts:\n- K. Shivaram Karanth was born on 10 October 1902 and died on 9 December 1997.\n- K. Shivaram Karanth was a Kannada writer, social activist, environmentalist, Yakshagana artist, filmmaker, and thinker.\n- Yakshagana is a traditional theatre form that combines dance, music, dialogue, costume, make-up, and stage techniques in a unique style.\n- Marali Mannige is a Kannada novel by K. Shivaram Karanth.\n- Shuddha Saveri is a rāgam in Carnatic music and in Yakshagana music.",
